# Titan 2 Elite hardware keyboard: with "Keep the emoji picker open after typing an emoji" off, the
# full emoji picker opened with SYM closes after an emoji and after a skin tone, and the next key
# types into the editor, whatever the SYM auto-close settings.
# Needs the setting off (the runner does not change settings), the SYM page "Emoji picker" enabled
# after the default pages (device, emoji, symbols; SYM four times opens it), 😀 and 👋🏽 visible when
# the picker opens (recents or the first page).
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout qwerty
preserve keyboard mode
hw type ok
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
wait 500
hw type a
expect Ok😀a
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen hold emoji:👋🏽
wait 1000
screen release emoji:👋🏽
wait 300
screen press variant:👋🏿
wait 500
hw type b
expect Ok😀a👋🏿b
